========================================================================
O88 — SU(12) -> SU(4) x SU(3) Branching Rules
========================================================================

SU(12) -> SU(4) x SU(3) via tensor product: 12 = (4, 3)
  IDCM: 12 = B x N_gen = 4 x 3

  12 = (4, 3)
      dim: 4x3 = 12
  12x = (4x, 3x)
      dim: 4x3 = 12

  66 = Lambda^2(12) = (6, 6) + (10, 3x)  [from O59]
      dim: 6x6 + 10x3 = 36+30 = 66
  78 = Sym^2(12) = (10, 6) + (6, 3x)  [from O59]
      dim: 10x6 + 6x3 = 60+18 = 78

  143 = Adj(12) = (15, 1) + (1, 8) + (15, 8)
      dim: 15+8+120 = 143 = 143

  220 = Lambda^3(12), dim = C(12,3) = 220
  495 = Lambda^4(12), dim = C(12,4) = 495
  792 = Lambda^5(12), dim = C(12,5) = 792
  924 = Lambda^6(12), dim = C(12,6) = 924 (self-dual)

========================================================================
36 = 3x12: 3 代 SU(4) x SU(3) 分解
========================================================================

  36 = 3x(4, 3) = (4, 3x3) = (4, 6) + (4, 3x)
      3x12 = 36 = 3x4x3 = 36
      dim: 4x6 + 4x3 = 24+12 = 36

  Under SU(4)_PS -> SU(3)_c x U(1)_{B-L}:
    4 = 3_{1/3} + 1_{-1}
    4x = 3x_{-1/3} + 1_{1}
    6 = Lambda^2(4) = 3x_{2/3} + 3_{-2/3}
    10 = Sym^2(4) = 6_{2/3} + 3_{-2/3} + 1_{-2}

  (4, 3x) for 3 generations:
    = (3, 3x)_{1/3} + (1, 3x)_{-1}
    = 9 quarks (3 colors x 3 gen) + 3 leptons (3 gen)
    dim: 9+3 = 12

  Under SU(4)_PS -> SU(2)_L x SU(2)_R:
    4 = (2, 2), 4x = (2, 2)
    6 = (3, 1) + (1, 3)
    10 = (1, 1) + (3, 3)

========================================================================
SM Fermion Content — 3 Generations
========================================================================

  Per generation (Pati-Salam):
    (4, 2, 1)_L = 8 Weyl: Q_L + L_L
    (4x, 1, 2)_R = 8 Weyl: u^c_R + d^c_R + e^c_R + nu^c_R
    Total per gen: 16 Weyl fermions
    3 generations: 3 x 16 = 48 Weyl fermions

  Under SU(3)_c x SU(2)_L x U(1)_Y (per generation):
    Q_L = (3, 2)_{1/6}  (6 Weyl)
    u^c_R = (3x, 1)_{-2/3}  (3 Weyl)
    d^c_R = (3x, 1)_{1/3}  (3 Weyl)
    L_L = (1, 2)_{-1/2}  (2 Weyl)
    e^c_R = (1, 1)_{1}  (1 Weyl)
    nu^c_R = (1, 1)_{0}  (1 Weyl)
    Total: 6+3+3+2+1+1 = 16

========================================================================
核心: 12 = (4, 3) 的 SM 內容
========================================================================

  12 = (4, 3) under SU(4)_PS x SU(3)_gen
  4 = 3_{1/3} + 1_{-1} under SU(3)_c x U(1)_{B-L}
  12 = (3, 3)_{1/3} + (1, 3)_{-1}
     = 9 quarks (3 colors x 3 generations) + 3 leptons (3 generations)
     = 12 Weyl fermions (LEFT chirality)

  12x = (4x, 3x) = (3x, 3x)_{-1/3} + (1, 3x)_{1}
     = 9 anti-quarks + 3 anti-leptons
     = 12 Weyl fermions (RIGHT chirality)

  3x(12+12x) = 72 Weyl fermions:
    36 = 3x12  -> 27 left-handed quarks + 9 left-handed leptons
    36x = 3x12x -> 27 right-handed quarks + 9 right-handed leptons
    Total: 54 quarks + 18 leptons = 72 Weyl fermions

  SM: 48 Weyl fermions (36 quarks + 12 leptons)
  3x(12+12x): 72 Weyl fermions (54 quarks + 18 leptons)
  Extra: 24 vector-like pairs -> mass at high scale

========================================================================
關鍵解析: 12 = (4, 3) 如何匹配 SM?
========================================================================

  12 = (4, 3) under SU(4)_PS x SU(3)_gen

  SU(4)_PS -> SU(3)_c x U(1)_{B-L}:
    4 = 3_{1/3} + 1_{-1}

  SO 12 = (3, 3)_{1/3} + (1, 3)_{-1}
    (3, 3)_{1/3}: 9 個左旋夸克 (3 色 x 3 代)
    (1, 3)_{-1}: 3 個左旋輕子 (3 代)

  12x = (4x, 3x) = (3x, 3x)_{-1/3} + (1, 3x)_{1}
    (3x, 3x)_{-1/3}: 9 個右旋反夸克
    (1, 3x)_{1}: 3 個右旋反輕子

  3x(12+12x) = 72: 3 代完整 fermion content
  Anomaly-free: 3x(+1) + 3x(-1) = 0

  IDCM 對應:
    36 = 3 x 12 = h11 = K_tree + N_gen = 33+3
    36x = 3 x 12x = h11 的共軛

  為什麼 72 而不是 48?
    3x(12+12x) = 72 包含 24 個 vector-like 配對
    這些配對在 SU(4)_PS -> SU(2)_L x SU(2)_R 破缺時
    透過 Higgs 機制獲得質量，留下 48 個零質量 Weyl fermions


結果已保存: data/02_fermion_embedding.json
